a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%99%E4%BB%99\" title=\"牙仙\"><img alt=\"牙仙\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%99%E4%BB%99\" title=\"牙仙\">牙仙</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红土地</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305303</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3053/305303/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">现代草地网球的发源地，也是牙仙选手的家乡。她的一举一动，就像贵族们最初希望的那样，优雅、干脆而从容。她如同球场上的手术医师——扣杀果断，截击精准，切削老练。她在开球前拍球三次，每次落点都控制在同一个位置，让人联想起手术前的准备。<br />在一发完美的爱司球后，牙仙选手露出了难得一见的、舒畅的笑容。观众们为她的表现大声喝彩，也不由好奇，她是否为了追求这项运动中与手术截然不同的大力与多变，才选择投身其中？<br />当然，还是有细心的记者注意到了，牙仙似乎随身携带了会飞的“球童”，它们喜爱追逐黄绿色的网球远胜于追逐那些扭曲奇特的牙齿，这似乎违背了生物的本能。然而牙仙选手赛后并没有接受记者的采访，因为当时她正忙于追捕某只把乌尔里希的头当网球的调皮牙仙子。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/94/Belonging-305304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">运动发箍<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sports Headband</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />80<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>收束飘扬的长发，散发出明亮感的发箍。它将琐屑与离晃的事物束于肩后，运动员的眼眸得以凝结在那一颗全场聚焦的小小荧黄色上。这无疑是让运动凝肃成一种美的先锋尝试。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fb/Belonging-305305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">得手应心<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">An Extra Hand</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />20<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>镀银的牙仙徽标，加以天然羊肠线构成网线的球拍，其张力超乎寻常，但不耐损及昂贵价格令不少运动员望而却步。这应该是她的底牌之一。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-305306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">铝制护颚器<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Aluminum Orthodontic Headgear</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>外戴便携型的护颚器，既能保证唇齿紧闭，亦能保证脖颈与下颚可得到最大程度的放松。<br />那群小东西恐怕根本跟不上她的速度。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 贝果核1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B81.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 贝果核2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B82.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">贝果核 <small style=\"color: grey\">Bagel</small></span></span>"}}